      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 2698: 🔴 `isAuthorizedCommit()` allows unknown commit types in non-document modes via `return mode() !\u003d ConversationMode::DOCUMENT;` without checking role-based permission. This bypasses `hasPermissionAtTree()` for the fallback path, so an `INVITED` participant (who should only be allowed to `Join`) can still submit arbitrary unknown commits. Keep forward-compatibility, but gate fallback through an explicit permission check (for example `allowed(Permission::Text)`), or add a dedicated `Permission::UnknownMessage` granted only to ADMIN/MEMBER.",
